                                                "example_id": "3f88a1e2-84b9-4d1b-a0b7-dc35129c7697",
                                                "sense_id": "de03873c-7589-3a6a-a4d7-1a38936b61be",
                                                "text": "I'm taking a course in advanced knitting techniques."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "06f532bc-810a-3492-8e5c-4278c3f31600",
                                        "entry_id": "10653bc2-043a-356c-ad74-67ee750abf2c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having moved forward in time or space (e.g. advanced ignition timing)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "084b0882-c9c9-4b2f-9ee6-a57883f2f554",
                                                "sense_id": "06f532bc-810a-3492-8e5c-4278c3f31600",
                                                "text": "a gentleman advanced in years, with a hard experience written in his wrinkles"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99d7ee1b-e7fa-42f2-95e3-b45abe21367c",
                                                "sense_id": "06f532bc-810a-3492-8e5c-4278c3f31600",
                                                "text": "The length of the stoppages could not well be reduced; indeed, they are already too short if we are to believe the tale now current of a wandering Jew sort of passenger—a lady of advanced years who can only alight from a train backwards. Every time she begins to get out a porter rushes up crying \"Hurry up, ma'am; train's going!\"—and pushes her in again!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0ac4e834-9113-3541-856c-2dd46f8f7c66",
                                        "entry_id": "10653bc2-043a-356c-ad74-67ee750abf2c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a late stage of development or education; having greatly progressed beyond an initial stage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24b32b23-9bc7-4c7b-9d9b-ea97cc283485",
                                                "sense_id": "0ac4e834-9113-3541-856c-2dd46f8f7c66",
                                                "text": "This is an advanced prototype, it already has most of the features the final product will have."
